# The fp32 graph is an intermediate: tools/export_onnx.py writes it and
# tools/quantize.py reads it, and the page only ever loads the int8 one.
#
# This used to say "npm run capture of the model is tools/export_onnx.py",
# written when there was no npm run capture. There is one now and it records the
# page as a GIF, so the sentence pointed a reader at a real command that does
# something else entirely.
build-model/router.onnx
build-model/

# Playwright's working directory while npm run capture is filming. It is removed
# when the run finishes and left behind when the run dies, which is exactly when
# somebody is committing in a hurry.
.capture
